# Windows IN meter

`apply_modem_audio` decays `audio_in_db` toward `AUDIO_FLOOR_DB` on Windows when the modem does not send a live input level and the channel is not `rx`. Do not "fix" IN by opening WASAPI capture or `IAudioMeterInformation` on the capture endpoint — that glitched modem73 MFSK CRC (v0.1.46). Render-only peak for OUT is fine.
